    "title": "Weslaco man sentenced to prison for alien smuggling conspiracy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Richards ,\n4 hours ago CORPUS CHRISTI, Texas — A 21-year-old Weslaco man has been sentenced to 36 months in federal prison for his involvement in a conspiracy to smuggle illegal aliens, according to Acting U.S. Attorney John G.E. Marck. Hugo Jimenez Jr. pleaded guilty on Nov. 13, 2025. U.S. District Judge David S.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
